Did you guys play yet?

284
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:25,880
My team won earlier.

285
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:26,660
Well, that's cool.

286
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,360
Congratulations.

287
00:13:27,780 --> 00:13:28,560
Thanks for that.

288
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:31,820
So then I guess you two know each other?

289
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:34,240
We trained at the Youth Intensive together.

290
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,500
This is Hoshiyumi.

291
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:36,820
Intensive?

292
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:40,280
So these two are on your team.

293
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:40,880
Yeah.

294
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,180
