Well, now.

401
00:19:50,620 --> 00:19:51,020
Hmm?

402
00:19:51,140 --> 00:19:53,440
Look, guys, it's the trailer park tit, Willows.

403
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:54,640
Good job, kids.

404
00:19:54,820 --> 00:19:56,120
You made it all this way.

405
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:58,320
